<title>SPAIN: Corp Banesto sells 5 pct of Urbis.</title>
<headline>Corp Banesto sells 5 pct of Urbis.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Corporacion Banesto, part of the Banco Espanol de Credito (Banesto) group, said on Wednesday it had placed five percent of real estate group Urbis for three billion pesetas with domestic and international investors.</p>
<p>The sale leaves Grupo Banesto with 66 percent of Urbis' capital, Corp Banesto said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The placement, carried out to increase liquidity and distribution of Urbis shares in the bourse in no way alters the group's policy of maintaining a controlling stake in the group,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34  1585 2167</p>
